  "idea": "Make.com scenario that auto-generates branded invoices upon payment",
  "text": "Here is how seven-figure businesses automate their bookkeeping workflows. Fast-scaling companies process hundreds of transactions weekly, making manual invoicing physically unsustainable for finance teams. Relying on manual data entry causes expensive billing discrepancies and forces founders to hire unnecessary administrative staff. Connect Stripe directly to Make to generate branded invoices, update QuickBooks, and notify finance channels on Slack. You scale transaction volume seamlessly without adding headcount.",
